        "description": "Calculates the absolute value of the cells in a raster.",
        "in_raster_or_constant.descr": "<xdoc><p>The input raster for which to calculate the absolute values.</p><p>To use a number as an input for this parameter, the cell size and extent must first be set in the environment.</p></xdoc>",
